'''Talpiddians''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that existed in [[the galaxy]]. They had acute [[eye]]sight at close range, but had difficulty identifying individuals of other species, particularly [[human]]s. Their [[hair]] could stand on end as a threat gesture, or when they were nervous. [[Huper Tenrecs]] was a Talpiddian weapons specialist who worked with the [[Resistance]].<ref name="TROS VD" /> The species shared its name with [[Talpiddi system|Talpiddi]], an astronomical object in the [[Outer Rim Territories]].<ref name="Galaxy Map">[[Star Wars Galaxy Map (poster)|''Star Wars'' Galaxy Map poster]]</ref>

